# Allowlist: the image build needs exactly these paths (see the COPY lines
# in Containerfile). Everything else - .git, .cx/, benchmark/, uploads/,
# docs/, tests/, caches, node_modules, dist - stays out of the context.
# (The previous blocklist allowed a 1.88GB context; this caps it at ~4MB.)
*
!src
!config
!VERSION
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.egg-info
